  "description": "<p data-end=\"391\" data-start=\"30\">Latvian Candles specializes in handcrafted silicone molds designed specifically for beeswax candle making. Our molds are made with precision, ensuring high-quality results for hobbyists and small businesses alike. With a deep passion for sustainable and creative craftsmanship, we aim to provide candle makers with the best tools to bring their ideas to life.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"761\" data-start=\"424\">Our premium-grade silicone molds are flexible, durable, and designed for easy de-molding. They come in various intricate designs, from traditional pillar candles to modern artistic shapes, perfect for beeswax candles. Each mold is made from high-quality, non-toxic silicone that withstands high temperatures, ensuring long-lasting use.</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1256\" data-start=\"801\">\r\n<li data-end=\"936\" data-start=\"801\"><strong data-end=\"830\" data-start=\"803\">Specialized for Beeswax</strong> &ndash; Our molds are crafted specifically for beeswax, ensuring smooth release and perfect detail retention.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1028\" data-start=\"937\"><strong data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"939\">Handmade Quality</strong> &ndash; Each mold is carefully handcrafted for durability and precision.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1155\" data-start=\"1029\"><strong data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1031\">Unique Designs</strong> &ndash; Our collection features exclusive, detailed designs that help candle makers create standout products.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1256\" data-start=\"1156\"><strong data-end=\"1188\" data-start=\"1158\">Sustainable &amp; Eco-Friendly</strong> &ndash; We prioritize environmentally friendly materials and packaging.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1282\" data-start=\"1258\"><strong data-end=\"1280\" data-start=\"1262\">Payment Terms:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1499\" data-start=\"1283\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1372\" data-start=\"1283\">We accept <strong data-end=\"1345\" data-start=\"1295\">PayPal, credit/debit cards, and bank transfers</strong> for secure transactions.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1429\" data-start=\"1373\">Orders are processed upon full payment confirmation.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1499\" data-start=\"1430\">Bulk orders may qualify for special pricing or installment plans.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1529\" data-start=\"1501\"><strong data-end=\"1527\" data-start=\"1505\">Shipping info:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1835\" data-start=\"1530\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1621\" data-start=\"1530\"><strong data-end=\"1554\" data-start=\"1532\">Worldwide Shipping</strong> 🌍 &ndash; We deliver internationally with reliable shipping partners.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1724\" data-start=\"1622\"><strong data-end=\"1650\" data-start=\"1624\">Custom Molds Available</strong> &ndash; Have a unique design in mind? We offer custom mold creation services!</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1835\" data-start=\"1725\"><strong data-end=\"1747\" data-start=\"1727\">Customer Support</strong> &ndash; Need help? Our friendly support team is available to assist you with any questions.</li>\r\n</ul>",
